    closure the build will. The --with seeds matter most: a --with straddle's
    additional_installs are only reachable when that straddle is a walk root,
    so without them the loop never clones e.g. hw-lilygo-tdeck's spangap-lcd and the
    build silently drops it (soft + absent). Slash-form --with names may not be
